<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (The development process begins with building the React frontend for dynamic UI and integrating WebRTC for real-time communication. The FastAPI server is developed to handle backend logic and route API calls, while BlueBot-1x is integrated for intelligent user interactions. An AI inference engine is deployed to run vision and voice models. Node.js is used to connect third-party APIs and manage services. A Convex database ensures real-time data storage, and an authentication service secures user access, enabling personalized BI-driven insights.)
/E (The development process begins with building the React frontend for dynamic UI and integrating WebRTC for real-time communication. The FastAPI server is developed to handle backend logic and route API calls, while BlueBot-1x is integrated for intelligent user interactions. An AI inference engine is deployed to run vision and voice models. Node.js is used to connect third-party APIs and manage services. A Convex database ensures real-time data storage, and an authentication service secures user access, enabling personalized BI-driven insights.)
/Pg 20 0 R
/K [7]
>>
