/T (The system undergoes rigorous testing through unit tests for individual components, integration testing across services \(FastAPI, Node.js, BlueBot-1x\), and end-to-end testing for the React frontend. WebRTC streams are tested for latency and reliability. AI models are validated with test datasets for accuracy and WandB. Logging and monitoring are implemented using tools like  Swagger and browser dev tools to identify and debug API issues, ensuring a stable, secure, and high-performing BI-driven application.)
